
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Alghimistry News | Market Intelligence</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      background: #090d16;
      color: #e8edf5;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }
    header {
      padding: 20px 6%;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #222b3b;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 15px;
    }
    .logo { font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; }
    .logo span { color: #d9ad61; }
    .status { color: #70d6a0; font-size: 12px; }
    nav {
      padding: 15px 6%;
      display: flex;
      gap: 25px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #222b3b;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }
    nav a { color: #9da9bb; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; }
    nav a:hover { color: #d9ad61; }
    main { padding: 35px 6%; max-width: 1400px; margin: auto; }
    .welcome { margin-bottom: 30px; }
    .welcome small { color: #d9ad61; letter-spacing: 2px; }
    h1 { font-size: 30px; margin: 12px 0; }
    .muted { color: #8995a8; line-height: 1.6; }
    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin: 25px 0 35px;
    }
    .card {
      background: #111927;
      border: 1px solid #263246;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .card small { color: #98a5b8; }
    .value { font-size: 25px; font-weight: bold; margin: 13px 0; }
    .gold { color: #e5bd75; }
    .green { color: #6bd69a; }
    .red { color: #ed7777; }
    .section-title { margin: 25px 0 16px; font-size: 20px; }
    .news {
      background: #111927;
      border: 1px solid #263246;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 13px;
    }
    .tag {
      color: #e5bd75;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .news h3 { margin: 12px 0; font-size: 17px; }
    .news p { color: #98a5b8; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 14px; }
    .ai {
      border: 1px solid #80643b;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg,#201c17,#111927);
    }
    button {
      background: #d9ad61;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 7px;
      padding: 11px 17px;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid #263246;
      padding: 25px 6%;
      color: #8995a8;
      font-size: 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    @media(max-width:600px) {
      h1 { font-size: 25px; }
      main { padding: 25px 5%; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">ALGHIMISTRY <span>NEWS.</span></div>
  <div class="status">● MARKET INTELLIGENCE</div>
</header>

<nav>
  <a href="#home">Dashboard</a>
  <a href="#market">Market Overview</a>
  <a href="news.html">Financial News</a>
  <a href="#ai">AI Intelligence</a>
  <a href="#calendar">Economic Calendar</a>
</nav>

<main id="home">
  <section class="welcome">
    <small>FINANCIAL INTELLIGENCE PLATFORM</small>
    <h1>Understand The Market.<br><span class="gold">Anticipate The Future.</span></h1>
    <p class="muted">
      Platform berita ekonomi dan analisis fundamental
      berbasis AI untuk membantu trader memahami pergerakan pasar.
    </p>
  </section>

  
<h2 class="section-title" id="market">Market Overview</h2>

<div class="tradingview-widget-container" style="width:100%;margin-bottom:30px;">
  <div class="tradingview-widget-container__widget"></div>
  <div class="tradingview-widget-copyright">
    <a href="https://www.tradingview.com/markets/" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">
      Market data by TradingView
    </a>
  </div>
  <script type="text/javascript" src="https://s3.tradingview.com/external-embedding/embed-widget-ticker-tape.js" async>
  {
    "symbols": [
      {"proName":"OANDA:XAUUSD","title":"Gold / XAUUSD"},
      {"proName":"TVC:DXY","title":"US Dollar Index"},
      {"proName":"TVC:US10Y","title":"US 10Y Yield"},
      {"proName":"TVC:USOIL","title":"WTI Oil"}
    ],
    "showSymbolLogo": true,
    "isTransparent": true,
    "displayMode": "adaptive",
    "colorTheme": "dark",
    "locale": "en"
  }
  </script>
</div>

<h2 class="section-title" id="ai">AI Fundamental Intelligence</h2>
  <div class="card ai">
    <span class="tag">ALGHIMISTRY AI ENGINE</span>
    <h2 style="margin:15px 0">Market Intelligence</h2>
    <p class="muted">
      Sistem AI nantinya akan menganalisis berita, data ekonomi,
      kebijakan The Fed, dan potensi dampaknya terhadap XAUUSD.
    </p>
    <button onclick="alert('AI Intelligence akan diaktifkan pada tahap integrasi API.')">
      Explore AI Intelligence
    </button>
  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title" id="calendar">Economic Calendar</h2>

  <section style="
    background:#0e1118;
    border:1px solid #2b303b;
    border-radius:14px;
    padding:20px;
    margin-bottom:18px;
  ">
    <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;color:#858b98;">
      FUNDAMENTAL MONITORING
    </div>
    <h3 style="margin:12px 0 8px;color:#f1f3f8;font-size:20px;">
      USD Focus (United States)
    </h3>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#9da4b2;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;">
      Pantau jadwal rilis data ekonomi Amerika Serikat yang berpotensi
      memengaruhi US Dollar dan harga Emas (XAUUSD).
    </p>
  </section>

  <section style="
    background:#191711;
    border:1px solid #3b3220;
    border-radius:12px;
    padding:14px 18px;
    margin-bottom:18px;
    color:#c9a45c;
    font-size:13px;
    line-height:1.6;
  ">
    <strong>Trading Tip:</strong>
    Perhatikan CPI, PCE, PPI, NFP, ISM, dan FOMC.
    Volatilitas bisa meningkat saat data aktual berbeda dari ekspektasi.
  </section>

  <section style="
    width:min(1100px, calc(100vw - 48px));
    margin-left:calc((100% - min(1100px, calc(100vw - 48px))) / 2);
    box-sizing:border-box;
    background:#0e1118;
    border:1px solid #2b303b;
    border-radius:14px;
    padding:12px;
    overflow:hidden;
    color-scheme:dark;
    --tv-widget-background-color:transparent;
    --tv-widget-text-color:#d1d4dc;
    --tv-widget-accent-color:#d4ad62;
  ">
    <tv-economic-calendar
  countries="us"
  theme="dark"
  style="display:block;width:100%;height:650px;min-height:650px;background:transparent;">
</tv-economic-calendar>
  </section>

  <script type="module" src="https://widgets.tradingview-widget.com/w/id/tv-economic-calendar.js"></script>
</main>

<footer>
  ALGHIMISTRY NEWS © 2026 · FINANCIAL MARKET INTELLIGENCE
  <p style="margin-top:8px">Informasi dan analisis bukan jaminan pergerakan pasar.</p>
</footer>


</body>
</html>
